            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0710" n="660" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv12/pg660"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 181.9202/55: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Bandholtz to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-28">August 28, 1919</date>.<lb/>[Received August 30—2:23
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>33. Someone certainly backing Roumania. I believe it is Italy in effort to
                    isolate Jugoslavs.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bandholtz</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
